Clans: An Overview
------------------

Clans are first and foremost a social medium, allowing players the ability
to form organized groups outside the confines of guilds. In addition to
the purely social aspect of clans, clans also add to the game by allowing for
clan warfare. 

Non-warfare features of clans:
  -- Clan channel
  -- Clan headquarters
     -- Place to store items and equipment
     -- Place to deposit money into a shared clan coffers
  -- Customized clan emote
  -- Clan rankings and reputations

Warfare-specific features of clans:
  -- Ability to mutually agree to a war with another clan leader
  -- Detailed post-war information (# kills, best kill, etc)
  -- Opportunity to increase clan reputation rapidly
  -- All clan wars are set in duration (minimum of 5 days)
  -- Clan warfare ignores normal PK status (ie. Non-PKers can kill/be killed)

Please see "help clans_basics" for a more detailed intro to clans.
Please see "help clans_war" for warfare information.
Please see "help clans_cmds" for clan command information.
